 scen_h="An illustrative equity decision",
 scen=["An owner holds a rental worth about $400,000 with a $210,000 balance and wants capital for another purchase. The gross gap is $190,000; the usable number is smaller after program leverage limits, closing costs and any reserve requirements, and the new payment is larger for as long as the loan runs. Illustrative example, not a customer.",
      "The decision is whether the next investment earns more than the refinance costs, on both properties, at the same time."],
